
Problem Statement
Hospital Patient Management System using Linked List
Develop a simple C++ Hospital Patient Management System using a singly linked list. The 
system should allow the user to:
Add a new patient with Patient ID and Name.
Display all patient records.
Search for a patient using Patient ID.
Exit the system.
The patient records are stored using nodes of a linked list, where each node contains the 
patient ID, patient name, and a pointerto the next patient.

Objective
1.To develop a simple Hospital Patient Management System using C++.
2.To implement a singly linked list for storing patient records.
3.To add and store patient details such as ID and name.
4.To display all patient records efficiently.
5.To search for a patient using their Patient ID.
